argin-bottom:0;box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:4px;font-size:16px;margin=
:0"><span>In </span><em>Technology and the Rise of Great Powers</em><span>,=
 I estimate AI=E2=80=99s arrival as a potential GPT to sometime in the mid-=
to-late 2010s. This is based on a 2018 census survey metric, with 2.75 perc=
ent of firms in the median sector reporting the use of AI technologies. If =
AI follows the path of electricity and the computer, we will not even get c=
lose to 70 percent adoption across the economy =E2=80=94 let alone 90 perce=
nt! =E2=80=94 until after 2040. </span></p></li></ul><p style=3D"margin:0 0=
